    "sentence_translations": [
      "I Don’t Want to Get Out of Bed",
      "",
      "Mom: Have you seen what time it is? How come you still haven’t gotten out of bed? You have to get up and go to class!",
      "",
      "Son: I don’t have to go to class, mom. I’m not a student anymore. I don’t want to get out of bed!",
      "",
      "Mom: You’re the teacher now! Hurry and get up. Your students are all waiting for you to go to class!",
      ""
